{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Analog</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Analog</i> is game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1742549777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Skin off</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Skin off</i> is the first game in <i>Analog,</i> where you play as a teenager during summer break. You decide to stay at your uncle's house away from the city with your friends. A strange message, however, appears on the TV that changes your plans. <strong>Follow the instruction</strong> if you want to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1742549777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its <strong>VHS like visuals</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>creepy atmosphere\u00a0</strong><i>Skin off</i> fully immerses you to its nostalgic\u00a0<strong>90's aesthetic</strong>, so you can experience analog horror in the appropriate environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544080?t=1742549777","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544080?t=1742549777","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/7deea6b8fa1f0d110a51b027fdde935e6df09561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742549777","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/7deea6b8fa1f0d110a51b027fdde935e6df09561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742549777","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_descri